Description:The opponent has nine poison counters and controls Grizzly Bears and Sea Scryer; Sea Scryer has +3/+3 from Giant Growth until end of turn (a 4/4 now). You have one black mana floating (it empties at the end of this phase) and Virulent Wound in hand. Win before the end of the opponent's next turn.
